      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-111907",
      ":question/problem": "Let $X$ and $Y$ be continuous random variables with the joint probability density function\n$f(x, y) = {4xy,\\begin{vmatrix}0 \\le x \\le 1, 0 \\le y \\le 1, \\\\ 0,\\end{vmatrix}otherwise$.\nFind the expression for the corresponding joint CDF when $0 \\le x \\le 1, 0 \\le y \\le 1$."
